      "id": "M4117-A",
      "skill": "engineering-application-journal-writing-skill",
      "prompt": "A. 请根据当前Skill的可追溯记录，判断分类器logit计算的energy function、energy score、free energy分别有哪些已核实的英文定义与中文译法。要求给两篇英文来源的具体定义位置，说明中文来源的身份及已读位置。一名学生准备把物理振动能量论文与作者网站中译版都计为独立的分类能量机制证据，并写“能量值就是样本为未知故障的概率”。请给出你的术语决定和一条简洁的英文方法表述，不添加实验结果。不能访问原始论文，只使用当前Skill已记录的依据，缺失则说明。",
      "required_behaviors": [
        "Use P18/P51 definition locations with distinct source names and temperature convention.",
        "Use checked Chinese energy-function/score sources while retaining the exact free-energy translation as unverified, not invalid.",
        "Distinguish author-hosted translation from independent definition and physical energy from logit score; do not assert calibrated probability.",
        "Keep unsupported probability interpretation in the author note, not a routine negative tail in the English method sentence."
      ],
      "forbidden_behaviors": [
        "Treat an English paper and its translation as two independent works.",
        "Invent a verified free-energy Chinese source or unknown-class probability."
      ],
      "outcome": "pass",
      "reason": "Matched source definitions, scoped Chinese checks and source identities; affirmative replacement prose after initial repair.",
      "evaluator": "Maintainer semantic review; no independent second grader",
